---

This repository builds on third-party work distributed under its own terms:
  * Blind-Touch (Choi, Woo & Kim, AAAI 2024) - the reproduced baseline and the
    CNN architecture in baseline-blind-touch/.
  * flash-psi (Bui & Cong, CANS 2025; github.com/kc1212/flash-psi) - the FLPSI
    protocol implementation. Only our patch and added binary are in crypto/.
  * SOCOFing (Shehu et al., 2018) - the fingerprint dataset, not redistributed here.
